<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran is mobilising a nationwide self-sacrifice campaign and threatening US diplomats while preparing possible strikes, and Houthi rebels continue attacks on Saudi oil facilities and airports, prompting the reopening of Riyadh Airport after weeks of disruption. Netanyahu warned of a second Holocaust and posted an AI image of a nuclear blast on Tel Aviv, leading IDF chief Eisenkot to call him hysterical. Trump said the US will not strike Iran today, even as US planners consider renewed strikes after the midterm elections. 123 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/25/world/middleeast/saudi-arabia-riyadh-airport-reopens.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/oct/23/oil-five-month-high-fears-us-renews-strikes-iran&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPMjkwTHd4cHVxclgwZXZZWU1ETW1PMVNad2FTSmhmWXlOOVc2WUJseFYxNGtUUFNENy1fZ29yZ3JYb3JzemZmTm5DUXhyckNZTV85dUFwZ1hFTEtnUHhieFEyUEg0cFA1TVlBSTlxOVctdUhXWXFSVmVBWWVTeFJCcUkwTldNeFZubVdzdzdVMjB2V0hPbWtQN1lGRFdTX0NSVGkzXy16QVZYd1dxdnNHOXlFZ3h2dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQQXpWdlJlTmVic0R3RHI1X0FXU2tYUktMSkhPd1NoNmM3c0pQZENuejlERzQwOGVkYjdRMS1RU1ctMHRsaW51b1BvYmFoT1dQWXM4TzVLc1dhVFdCSE9JOU4tVUNPaWtZMWkyN2g1NmFHbGxMMmVQZ2ZiVnZiSW5RREtZaUE5YkgxaE52RHRVX01HV0RQMW8zMy1wcl9Cdzg0VGI5ZVVxQnpHeHJqeV9mRHBSYXRhSnVF0gG-AUFVX3lxTE4yeTRYMzhLeExQRWVUd21IX2NJdW1UdXlMcExGNHE4UXdOZmM0SE1yMl9PZ2VRNG1zX2VsYld2R1dEUFdCQTRoM1dBTVFqZXJPbEF1U2FSVGZhTExkX21Ed21Idlg2dC01NUtxejdTWUpSODJVZjhpUkZZMndURkdQYjhxNnJmMjdKSXpUNzRMcTg2UjY5UFAtODJoYl9kOExvVEU1VW1lZ1MzYi1ra0ExWXpJMVYzbEMxQWlwTEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a